<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Feb tax receipts at 7.994 bln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Feb tax receipts at 7.994 bln reais.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's federal tax receipts totaled 7.994 billion reais in February compared with 6.427 billion reais in the same month a year ago, the Internal Revenue Service said.  </p>
<p>The tax office said in a statement that tax receipts in the first two months of 1997 were 16.399 billion reais, a 21.41 percent increase on revenue of 13.507 billion reais collected in the January-February period of 1996.</p>
<p>((-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358))</p>
